WEBVTT

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:11.320
It began with the MechaLion, Galeon, who arrived from a distant planet.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:16.160
He brought with him an alien space technology...

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:19.410
...paving the way to the birth of giant robots...

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.460
...and serving as mankind's primary defender.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:28.130
And the young boy Mamoru, who arrived with Galeon from outer space...

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:33.590
...wields an alien power to save humans under the enemy's influence.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.720
Who had built Galeon?

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.680
Who is Mamoru, the boy with supernatural powers?

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:49.320
And what is the true goal of the enemy who strives to Zonderize all mankind?

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.150
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:56.050
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:03.000
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:07.050
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:13.770
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:18.050
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:22.970
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.890
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:29.690
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:33.450
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:38.450
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.620
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.160
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.290
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.250
Warping dimensional space!

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.330
Dividing Driver!

00:01:56.150 --> 00:02:01.970
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:07.850
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.800
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:14.690
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.490
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.450
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:22.120
A World Devoid of Light

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.950
<i>A World Devoid of Light</i>

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.040
Thanks for your patience, ladies and gentlemen!

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:34.420
We will now begin the ceremony commemorating the maiden voyage...

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.130
...and the christening of this new deep-sea submersible.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.510
We've chosen a name out of the many suggestions we received...

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.010
...from grammar school children around the country.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.350
And now it's time for our two representatives to unveil that name.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.190
Now then, if you please!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.070
Yes, sir!

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.320
Ready, set, go!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.200
It's the Ryuuguu 9000!

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:07.330
This deep-sea submersible is named for the Dragon Palace visited by the...

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.210
...mythical Taro Urashima, and its dive depth of 9,000 meters.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.000
What a splendid name!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.710
Ryuuguu 9000, huh? Way cool!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.460
Ha! I guess it'll do.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.390
Now a word from Dr. Leo Shishioh, who provided so much support...

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.100
...during the development of the Ryuuguu 9000...

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.350
...as well as the captain of the Ryuuguu 9000's maiden voyage.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:38.730
Curses! No one's worthy of piloting that Ryuuguu 9000 but me!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.070
Ah... the uncharted seas are calling to me.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:46.200
What wouldn't I give to go down 10,000 meters below sea level!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.790
Would you really like to go?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.200
Who's there?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.420
Can't you hear it?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.300
That voice beckoning to you from the bottom of the deep, deep sea?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.760
Hear it? Hear it?

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:09.270
As you can see, it's the submersible we've all dreamed about.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:22.450
Gai!

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:24.610
A Zonder?

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:25.780
Wait...

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.450
Better not forget this...

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.330
Hey, thanks, Mikoto.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.300
No!

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.400
Hana!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.880
Equip!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.300
Mamoru!

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.140
Hey, it's that cyborg!

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:35.230
He's gonna save Mamoru and Hana!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.810
Oh, my Super-cool D.F.L!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:38.520
What's that?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:43.360
Super-cool Dreamboat with the Flowing Locks!

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:44.490
Oh... yeah?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.780
Will Knife!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:18.730
Gai here!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.440
My target's a submersible, there's no way I can catch up with it.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.900
Can you track it by satellite?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:24.820
Can you hear me, Gai?

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.360
Volfogg is on his way now!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.570
Volfogg? From Intelligence?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.410
He's on board the Multidimensional Intelligence Ship.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.910
The Multidimensional Intelligence Ship.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.710
Launched from the GGG Bay Tower Base, it is a mammoth mobile...

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:47.800
...computer system able to capture information from all over the world.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.940
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:03.810
I am the captain of the Ryuuguu 9000!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.440
I'm taking us all the way down to the bottom of the deepest sea on Earth.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:08.820
No!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.620
Deeper and deeper!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.750
This deep sea belongs to me!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.960
They didn't choose me to be captain for this voyage...

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.840
Zonder!

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.670
Zonder!

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:35.010
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.640
Grownups have a lot to deal with, don't they?

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.330
I won't let you go any deeper!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.420
Zonder!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.500
The GGG Multidimensional Intelligence Ship?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.340
It came to rescue us!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.590
I get it...

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.390
It's my pager that's telling them exactly where I am!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.060
All right, we've caught up with it.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.270
Wait.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:23.640
There's a naval submarine nearby.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.320
There's a deep-sea submersible in our path. It's dangerously close!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.700
Unless we change course we're going to collide!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.950
Evade! Turn as hard as you can!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.370
Emergency! Surface immediately!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.080
We've lost control!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.960
The engines have shut down! Abandon ship!

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.550
All hands, abandon ship!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.390
It appears to have been swallowed up by the submersible.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.440
No! Volfogg!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.690
If we get any closer, it could end up absorbing us, too.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.400
Are you saying that there's nothing we can do?

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.360
I'm analyzing the data now...

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:18.410
Let us wait for a command from the GGG Main Order Room.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.930
I have a report from Volfogg.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.850
The Zonder deep-sea submersible fused with a Self-Defense Force sub.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:52.820
It has increased in size, and is making its way up the Uraga Channel.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:57.150
So it's heading for the Sagami Gulf. Where on Earth is it planning to go?

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:01.120
My best guess would have to be the Mariana Trench.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.620
And your reason is?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:07.460
According to my data, the man who was turned into the Zonder host...

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.790
...seems to have been a well-known deep-sea submersible specialist.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:14.710
However, his bid to pilot the Ryuuguu 9000 was rejected by the committee.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:19.510
His desire is to dive to his heart's content in a high-tech submersible?

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.640
That explains why he's headed for the Mariana Trench.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:25.980
I suppose there's no better place to flex his muscles as a captain.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.940
10,000 meters below sea level, the Vityaz Deep!

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:33.860
There it is.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.110
Absolute pressure, 1,001.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.200
A place unknown to mankind.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.160
A world of darkness untouched even by light.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.690
It's breaking up!

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:27.240
I get it, the signal's too weak now.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.750
What should we do?

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:31.120
Curatio!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.880
Coctura!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:42.260
Even with all my powers, I still can't...

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:47.220
Even if I manage to purify that Zonder right now...

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.560
...we'll get crushed unless we get back to the surface...

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:54.860
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.900
What should I do? What should I do?

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:07.700
Purely unplanned, but what a stroke of luck to have captured that child.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.660
If that submersible continues its descent to the bottom of the sea...

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.500
...we'll be rid of the one person who can turn Zonders back into humans.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.590
What's gonna happen to Mamoru and Hana?

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.510
And my Super-cool Dreamboat!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:25.430
It's gonna be all right. I know they'll be rescued by GGG!

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.300
GGG?

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:31.230
It's a secret government defense force you guys don't know about.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.230
Are you sure there really is a force like that, Ushi?

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.520
Wait a minute, are you talking about that black robot?

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.820
I believe in them.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.440
You'll save Mamoru and Hana, won't you, Big Brother?

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:52.580
Gai, we're sending you on a mission to rescue Mamoru and his friend.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.870
You can get all the details from Ushiyama.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:58.630
You have a greater enemy than the Zonder, and that's water pressure.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:03.300
At 10,000m below sea level, the water pressure will be 1,001...

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:07.430
...or 1,001 kilograms of pressure for every square centimeter.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.600
Not even a cyborg can hope to survive that kind of pressure.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.810
All right, then how will I get down there?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:19.320
We'll implement a rescue plan using the Dividing Driver to create a field.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.820
Create a field?

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:24.950
Right, the Dividing Power will generate an internal repression field...

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.030
...while containing the exterior with an arresting field.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.540
You're going to make your descent to the lowest depths of the sea...

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.790
...while expanding that power.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.500
At 1,000 kilograms per square centimeter?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.670
Don't worry, you're more than capable of handling that, Gai.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.960
Also, since you'll be making your deep-sea dive at 1 kg per square cm...

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:44.470
...you'll be able to return to the surface without risking bodily harm.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.720
There's just one problem, though.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:47.380
What's that?

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.430
You'll be using massive amounts of energy under all that water pressure...

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:55.730
...so you'll only have 30 minutes before Dividing Power is depleted.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:14:01.650
You mean I'll have to dive 10,000 meters and get back in 30 minutes.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.730
Pretty gutsy plan!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.610
Fusion!

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:12.700
GaiGar!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:16.040
Symmetrical Docking!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.890
ChoRyuJin!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:40.600
Final Fusion!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.820
GaoGaiGar!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.610
Listen up, Gai.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.530
Now then, to put our rescue operation in motion...

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.450
...we're going to launch the GGG Submarine, Marine-1...

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.910
...which will make an initial dive of 6,000 meters...

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.870
...after which the Dividing Field will be created...

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.130
...so you can descend further to 10,000 meters.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:47.090
Captain Gai, I'll be waiting for your safe return.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.590
Right! Thanks!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.390
Be safe.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.990
Marine-1, dive in progress.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.400
Current depth?

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.450
4,250 meters.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:15.660
And the Ryuuguu 9000?

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.620
More than 8,000 meters.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:28.130
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.840
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.520
All right, Marine-1 has exceeded 6,000 meters.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.810
Ryuuguu 9000 is already over the 9,000-meter mark.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.020
I hope he makes it in time.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.690
Of course he'll make it!

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.110
Huh? Sure... of course.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.450
After all, Gai's a hero, isn't he!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.880
The water pressure is starting to dent Marine-1.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.920
Marine-1 can't take much more!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.050
No! It's going to get crushed!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.830
Marine-1 is destroyed!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:47.920
GaoGaiGar has created the Dividing Field and is now descending!

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.530
I'm not afraid! I'm not afraid!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.000
Look! We've gone deeper than 10,000 meters!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:29.830
This submersible can't go lower than 9,000 meters, right?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.250
Don't worry, we'll be all right.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.710
No way! We learned about it in class!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.760
We're going to get crushed by the water pressure!

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.770
Zonder!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.130
It's GaoGaiGar!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.800
GaoGaiGar's here to save us!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.020
Mamoru!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.070
Zonder!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.810
No! The Dividing Driver's out of power!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.950
We're out of time.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.240
So he didn't make it after all...

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.410
No...

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.450
GaoGaiGar can't be...

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.080
What about Mamoru?

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:21.300
Gai!

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:29.430
What's going on, ChoRyuJin?

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:33.180
Major Hyuuma, I have located Captain Gai.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.940
I am now pulling him out of the water!

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:38.310
We couldn't detect him by radar or sonar! How do you know?

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.860
This is Volfogg. I've detected traces of high energy below the water.

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:12.510
Two grammar school children and one submarine pilot... rescued.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:14.810
Mission accomplished.

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:15.520
Gai!

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:16.560
You did it!

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.480
I've confirmed the completion of your mission.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:22.520
You did a good job, Gai!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:25.780
Mamoru's mysterious power has once again...

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:28.450
...been successfully wielded in the deepest part of the ocean.

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:31.830
There's no question that young Mamoru holds the...

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:35.870
...key to the Zonder threat and the survival of mankind.

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.040
It's an amazing energy.

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:41.840
I am 100% certain that it is not of this world.

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:48.150
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:51.150
When the four gates leading to Hell are opened...

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.490
...all living things on Earth will be annihilated.

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:57.330
This is a prophecy from the Great Northern Lands, but can it be true?

00:23:57.490 --> 00:24:00.290
Rescue the scientists who have been captured by the Gatekeepers of Hell...

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:02.290
...the Four Machine Kings!

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.830
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:06.500
"The Gate of Isolde"

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:10.510
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:10.470
The Gate of Isolde

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:15.430
Volfogg

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:14.800
This is the Key to Victory!
